  "scope": "Hosted GitHub Actions run 39373895062 rebuilt this result-only reviewed-ir WIT/WASI component selection on Ubuntu 24.04. Two author roots reproduce the complete component archive, remove author roots, install offline, compile one unchanged public C caller, remove its source, relocate the installation and replay its binary through Wasmtime. The standalone result-only API exposes all eight proof-free indexed records without checked-input metadata. The archive authenticates the original workflow, job, artifact, toolchain log, TAP, reports, package receipt, component archive and exact source identities. Hosted WIT/WASI value-index acceptance covers only the archived top-level copied checked-record parameter and result sites with closed Bool, String and Nat indices. Full components cover parameters and results; standalone result-only components cover results only. Open or opaque indices; Int, Char, fixed-width and platform-width integers, Fin, functions, proofs, instances and other index kinds; checked-record fields, callbacks and owned positions; value-carrying dependent payloads; and zero-payload checked records remain unreviewed here. The run covers source-free installation and relocated replay through Wasmtime 42.0.1 and wasm-tools 1.245.1 on Ubuntu 24.04, Linux x64/glibc 2.39 with a glibc 2.38 package floor. Each component requires its packaged native Lean host and is not a standalone WASI command. Complete component archives, receipts, generated projections, caller binaries, reports, execution records, original workflow records and source closures are retained; external Lean, Nix, C, wasm-tools, Wasmtime and operating-system toolchains remain trusted recorded inputs. Other host targets require separate installed evidence.",
